# A short settled-screen tour for A/B captures across aspect ratios: it stops on each of the
# three menus long enough that a stride-1 filmstrip lands several frames on each, and then
# holds on the Select menu rather than looping, so a capture taken at any budget past the end
# is comparable frame-for-frame with another aspect's capture.
label boot-and-dialog
wait 260
press A 8
label logos-and-title
wait 640
press START 8
label main-menu-settle
wait 400
label mode-submenu
press A 8
wait 400
press DOWN 6
wait 120
label select-menu-settle
press A 8
wait 900
